{"format":1,"kind":"nrl","id":"nrl-2011","version":"nrl-2011-f9d1df62","year":2011,"season":"2011","label":"Computed from NRL.com match stats","local":false,"source":{"provider":"NRL.com","edition":"NRL.com match centre, the 2011 NRL premiership","compiler":"computed by imperialism-game from NRL.com's team lists and player stats (the NRL's own data); the positions of players who never started from the Rugby League Project","url":"https://www.nrl.com/draw/?competition=111&season=2011","retrieved":"2026-11-09","method":"computed","metric":"core points a club game: NRL Fantasy's points for eleven NRL.com stats, the season before at half weight","conversion":"No game rated the 2011 season: each overall is computed from NRL.com's match centre, the season's premiership games, regular season and finals. Players: everyone NRL.com lists taking the field (a player named off the field only with minutes or a counted stat); his club is the one he played most games for (of two as many, the last). Position: the one he started at most in the season by its team lists, whatever his jersey; else most in the seasons either side, then two either side; else the first of his positions on the Rugby League Project; else he is left out. Value: his core points a club game, NRL Fantasy's points for eleven stats (`core`: 8 a try, 5 a try assist, 4 a line break, 2 a line-break assist, 1 a tackle, -2 a missed tackle, 2 a tackle break, 4 an offload, -2 an error (where NRL.com records no errors for a game, as for every game of 2013-2015, a handling error), 1 every 10 metres run and 1 every 30 kicked; goals and field goals not counted), the season's in full and the season before's at half weight when he played in it, over his club's games in each. Overall: the value's mid-rank percentile among the season's players at his position (ties sharing one), read off `reference`, Rugby League 26's overalls at that position (scripts/data/rugby-league-26.json), as many of each 2025 club's best as the season's 